The experiment work~\cite{shen2025anomalousenergygapsuperconducting} has reported the energy gap distribution on $\beta$ pocket, to which our results are comparable, with smallest value of $g_t\Delta^{s\pm}$ on $\beta$ pocket along diagnal direction in Brillouin zone. 
