        where $\gamma_k$ are coupling constants and $\hat{I}_{\text{HR}}$ represents the cumulative imprint operator, which is relevant to the Hawking radiation process. This interaction allows imprints to manifest in the radiation, suggesting that Hawking radiation may contain observable correlations from the black hole's formation history.
