The estimation of $\iqrpe$ and $\cvpe$ contributes insights to the existing literature. %
We conclude from panels C and D that both effects negatively and significantly differ from zero, implying that although a higher UI benefit increases unemployment durations, it also tends to reduce the dispersion of durations.

