    \item add a reaction from the terminal complex to the $0$ complex, with the same rate constant as the reaction from the terminal complex to the product block in the original network. 
\end{enumerate}
Assumption \ref{assum:blocks}(4) implies that $\mathcal{G}_\ell$ is weakly reversible and has a single connected component. Thus by Lemma \ref{lem:unimolecular}, there exists a unique positive steady state, in which the compound $C_{\ell p}$ has the concentration denoted by $h_{\ell p}$. 


