\subsection{Robustness analysis with noise conditions}

As discussed in Section 3.2, we address scRNA-seq data challenges using a masking strategy where gene expression values are set to zero and Gaussian noise is added during data augmentation. To assess the impact of noise on JojoSCL’s performance, we compared results with and without noise, keeping other conditions constant. The findings are summarized in Table \ref{tab:noise_comparison}.

