    Classical                   & $\displaystyle
                                   \hat{\Omega}= -\textstyle{\frac{1}{N}}\,\hat{A}^{-1}
                                   \;=\;
                                   -\,\hat{H}^{-1}$ \\[4pt]
    Berndt–Hall–Hall-Hausman (BHHH)  & $\displaystyle
